rl-duckdb
=========

This image is based on DuckDB v1.5.5 with 0 RunningLake patches.

Upstream components, unmodified:

  DuckDB CLI v1.5.5             MIT      DuckDB Foundation
                                         https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb
  httpfs extension v1.5.5       MIT      DuckDB Foundation
                                         https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-httpfs
  avro extension v1.5.5         MIT      DuckDB Foundation
                                         https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-avro
  iceberg extension v1.5.5      MIT      DuckDB Foundation
                                         https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-iceberg
  json, icu, parquet            MIT      statically linked into the DuckDB CLI upstream
  gcr.io/distroless/cc-debian12 Apache-2.0 (image tooling); Debian packages under their
                                         own licences, see /usr/share/doc in the image

RunningLake components:

  rl-duckdb-runner              Apache-2.0  RunningLake
                                         https://github.com/runninglake/platform-bundle

DuckDB is a trademark of the DuckDB Foundation. This image is not an official DuckDB
distribution. Every sha256 this image was built from is recorded in
images/rl-duckdb/PINS.md in the repository above.
